"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Übung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">08</div><h1>소유관사</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Possessivartikel</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 08의 문법을 직접 풀어 보며 익혀요.<br>A1 수준의 문장으로, 기본 16 · 중간 8 · 도전 6 문제를 풀어요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 연습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">주인에 맞춰 소유관사의 앞부분을 골라요 — sein과 ihr를 구별해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">뒤 명사의 성·수·격에 맞춰 ein처럼 끝을 붙여요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">unser·euer와 존칭 Ihr의 모양을 바르게 써요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">명사 없이 meiner·meine·meins로 말해요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Das ist Jan und <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Hund.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) sein</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) seinen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) seine</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) ihr</button></div><div class=\"qe\">주인 Jan이 남성이라서 sein-이에요.<br>Hund는 남성 1격이라 끝이 없어요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Das ist Mia und <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Katze.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) ihre</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) seine</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) ihrer</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) ihr</button></div><div class=\"qe\">주인 Mia가 여성이라서 ihr-예요.<br>Katze는 여성 1격이라 끝 -e를 붙여요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Mein&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(ich · Name 남성)</span> Name ist Ole.</div><div class=\"qko\">제 이름은 올레예요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Mein</b> Name ist Ole.</div>ich → mein-, Name은 남성 1격이라 끝이 없어요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;deine&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Wo ist <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(du · Brille 여성)</span> Brille?</div><div class=\"qko\">네 안경 어디 있어?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wo ist <b>deine</b> Brille?</div>du → dein-, Brille는 여성 1격이라 -e를 붙여요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Ihr&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Ist das <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Sie(존칭) · Regenschirm 남성)</span> Regenschirm, Herr Roth?</div><div class=\"qko\">로트 씨, 이거 당신 우산이에요?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ist das <b>Ihr</b> Regenschirm, Herr Roth?</div>존칭 Sie의 소유관사는 Ihr이고 늘 대문자로 써요.<br>남성 1격이라 끝이 없어요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;mein&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> Ich suche <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(ich · Handy 중성)</span> Handy.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 내 휴대폰을 찾아요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich suche <b>mein</b> Handy.</div>중성 4격은 ein처럼 끝이 없어요 — mein Handy.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;unsere&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> Wir besuchen <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(wir · 복수)</span> Großeltern.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 우리 조부모님을 찾아뵈어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wir besuchen <b>unsere</b> Großeltern.</div>wir → unser-, 복수 4격은 -e예요. unser의 -er은 단어의 일부라서 그대로 남아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> Kennst du <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Onkel? (너희 삼촌)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) eurem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) euer</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) euren</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) eure</button></div><div class=\"qe\">남성 4격은 -en이에요. euer에 끝이 붙으면 가운데 e가 빠져서 euren이 돼요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;seiner&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> Er hilft <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(er · Schwester 여성)</span> Schwester.</div><div class=\"qko\">그는 자기 여동생을 도와줘요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Er hilft <b>seiner</b> Schwester.</div>helfen은 3격 동사예요. 주인 er → sein-, 여성 3격 → -er.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> Das Kind spielt mit <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Ball.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) seinen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) seinem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) sein</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) ihrem</button></div><div class=\"qe\">주인 das Kind가 중성이라서 sein-이에요.<br>mit 뒤는 3격, Ball은 남성이라 -em이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Meine&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(ich · 복수)</span> Eltern wohnen in Daegu.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리 부모님은 대구에 사세요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Meine</b> Eltern wohnen in Daegu.</div>한국어 '우리 부모님'은 말하는 사람 한 명의 부모님이라서 mein-이에요.<br>복수 1격은 -e예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> Wie alt ist <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Tochter, Herr Park?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Ihre</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) ihre</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) deine</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) seine</button></div><div class=\"qe\">Herr Park에게 존칭으로 묻는 말이라서 대문자 Ihr-예요.<br>Tochter는 여성 1격이라 -e예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;meinem&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> Ich schreibe <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(ich · Freund 남성)</span> Freund eine Karte.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 내 친구에게 카드를 써요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich schreibe <b>meinem</b> Freund eine Karte.</div>받는 사람은 3격이에요. 남성 3격은 dem처럼 -em이라서 meinem이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Heute besuche ich meine Tante&quot;,&quot;Ich besuche heute mei