class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wie heißt ihr Hund?</b></div>의문사 wie 바로 뒤에 동사가 와요.<br>'그녀의'는 ihr-, Hund는 남성 1격이라 끝이 없어요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> Lena zeigt <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Opa die Fotos. (자기 할아버지에게)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) ihrem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) ihren</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) ihr</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) seinem</button></div><div class=\"qe\">주인 Lena가 여성이라 ihr-예요. Opa가 남성이어도 sein-이 아니에요.<br>받는 사람은 3격, 남성 → -em.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;ihrer&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> Die Kinder danken <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Lehrerin · 여성)</span> Lehrerin.</div><div class=\"qko\">아이들은 자기들 선생님께 감사해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Kinder danken <b>ihrer</b> Lehrerin.</div>주인 die Kinder가 복수라서 ihr-예요.<br>danken은 3격 동사, 여성 3격 → -er.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;seinen&quot;],[&quot;seine&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> Tim sucht <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Schlüssel · 남성)</span> Schlüssel und <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(Jacke · 여성)</span> Jacke.</div><div class=\"qko\">팀은 자기 열쇠와 재킷을 찾아요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Tim sucht <b>seinen</b> Schlüssel und <b>seine</b> Jacke.</div>주인 Tim이 남성이라 둘 다 sein-이에요.<br>끝은 뒤 명사가 정해요 — 남성 4격 -en, 여성 4격 -e.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> Ist das sein Löffel? — Nein, das ist <span class=\"qblank\"></span>. (내 것)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) meine</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) mein</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) meins</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) meiner</button></div><div class=\"qe\">명사 없이 쓰면 끝을 다 붙여요.<br>Löffel은 남성 1격이라 meiner예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Am Sonntag kocht Anna für ihre Gäste&quot;,&quot;Anna kocht am Sonntag für ihre Gäste&quot;,&quot;Für ihre Gäste kocht Anna am Sonntag&quot;,&quot;Anna kocht für ihre Gäste am Sonntag&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">일요일에 안나는 자기 손님들을 위해 요리해요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">für</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Anna</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">ihre</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Gäste</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">kocht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Am</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Sonntag</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Am Sonntag kocht Anna für ihre Gäste.</b></div>주인 Anna가 여성이라 ihr-, für 뒤는 4격이고 복수라서 ihre예요.<br>Am Sonntag가 앞에 오면 동사 뒤에 주어가 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;euren&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> Wohnt ihr bei <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(ihr(너희) · 복수)</span> Eltern?</div><div class=\"qko\">너희는 부모님 댁에 살아?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wohnt ihr bei <b>euren</b> Eltern?</div>bei 뒤는 3격이에요. 복수 3격 -en을 붙이면 euer → euren이 돼요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> Gefällt dir <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Mantel? (내 외투)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) mein</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) meiner</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) meinen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) meinem</button></div><div class=\"qe\">gefallen의 주어는 마음에 드는 물건이에요. Mantel은 남성 1격이라 끝이 없어요.<br>3격은 dir 쪽이고, meiner는 명사 없이 쓸 때의 모양이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;eurer&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> Wir helfen <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(ihr(너희) · Tochter 여성)</span> Tochter gern.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 너희 딸을 기꺼이 도와줘요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wir helfen <b>eurer</b> Tochter gern.</div>helfen은 3격 동사예요. 여성 3격 -er을 붙이면 euer → eurer가 돼요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Das Mädchen spielt mit seiner Puppe.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Frau Kaya liebt ihren Mann.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Sophie besucht seinen Opa.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Herr Kaya liebt seine Frau.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">주인 Sophie가 여성이라서 ihren Opa가 맞아요.<br>das Mädchen은 중성이라 sein-이 맞고, Puppe가 여성 3격이라 seiner예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Ihr&quot;],[&quot;sein&quot;],[&quot;ihrem&quot;],[&quot;Ihre&quot;],[&quot;ihrem&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> Das ist Familie Schmitt. <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(die Familie의 · Haus 중성)</span> Haus ist alt.<br>Herr Schmitt repariert <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(Herr Schmitt의 · Fahrrad 중성)</span> Fahrrad, und Frau Schmitt hilft <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(Frau Schmitt의 · Sohn 남성)</span> Sohn.<br><input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"><span class=\"qh\">(die Familie의 · Tochter 여성)</span> Tochter Ella spielt mit <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 5\"><span class=\"qh\">(Ella의 · Hund 남성)</span> Hund.</div><div class=\"qko\">슈미트 가족이에요. 그 가족의 집은 오래됐어요. 슈미트 씨는 자기 자전거를 고치고, 슈미트 부인은 자기 아들을 도와줘요. 그 가족의 딸 엘라는 자기 개와 놀아요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das ist Familie Schmitt. <b>Ihr</b> Haus ist alt.<br>Herr Schmitt repariert <b>sein</b> Fahrrad, und Frau Schmitt hilft <b>ihrem</b> Sohn.<br><b>Ihre</b> Tochter Ella spielt mit <b>ihrem</b> Hund.</div>die Familie는 여성이라서 ihr-로 받아요.<br>Herr Schmitt → sein Fahrrad(중성 4격), Frau Schmitt → ihrem Sohn(helfen + 3격), Ella → mit ihrem Hund(3격).</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Morgen zeige ich ihr unsere Wohnung&quot;,&quot;Ich zeige ihr morgen unsere Wohnung&quot;,&quot;Unsere Wohnung zeige ich ihr morgen&quot;,&quot;Ihr zeige ich morgen unsere Wohnung&quot;,&quot;Ich zeige ihr unsere Wohnung morgen&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">내일 나는 그녀에게 우리 집을 보여 줘요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Wohnung</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">unsere</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Morgen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">zeige</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">ihr</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Morgen zeige ich ihr unsere Wohnung.</b></div>대명사 ihr(3격)가 명사 목적어보다 앞에 와요.<br>Wohnung은 여성 4격이라 unsere예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;meiner&quot;],[&quot;meine&quot;],[&quot;meins&quot;,&quot;meines&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> Hier ist dein Teller, und da ist <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Teller · 남성)</span>.<br>Nimm deine Tasse, ich nehme <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(Tasse · 여성)</span>.<br>Das ist dein Glas, und das ist <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(Glas · 중성)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">여기 네 접시가 있고, 저기 내 것이 있어. / 네 컵을 가져가, 나는 내 것을 가져갈게. / 이건 네 유리잔이고, 이건 내 거야.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Hier ist dein Teller, und da ist <b>meiner</b>.<br>Nimm deine Tasse, ich nehme <b>meine</b>.<br>Das ist dein Glas, und das ist <b>meins</b>.</div>명사 없이 쓰면 끝으로 성과 격을 나타내요.<br>남성 1격 meiner, 여성 4격 meine, 중성 1격 meins예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> '우리는 우리 손님들과 너희 이웃 아주머니에게 감사해요.'<br>Wir danken <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Gästen und <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Nachbarin.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) unseren … euer</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) unsere … eure</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) unseren … eurer</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) unserem … eurer</button></div><div class=\"qe\">danken은 3격 동사예요. 복수 3격 → unseren, 여성 3격 → eurer.<br>euer는 끝이 붙으면 가운데 e가 빠져요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> Gehört der Rucksack Lisa? — Ja, das ist <span class=\"qblank\"></span>.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) ihre</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) ihrer</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) seiner</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) ihr</button></div><div class=\"qe\">주인 Lisa가 여성이라 ihr-예요.<br>명사 없이 남성 der Rucksack을 가리키니까 1격 끝 -er을 붙여 ihrer예요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"30\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 30</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"